# Deferred: tap haptics on buttons/links

**Do not implement until** desktop Flow Surface between Kado (block 2) and Cases (block 3) is soft-scrub only and feels correct.

Then add short Android `navigator.vibrate` on interactive taps:

- Shared helper (reuse/extend `app/utils/swarmHaptics.ts` or a sibling `tapHaptics.ts`)
- Android only; skip Apple / desktop; respect `prefers-reduced-motion`
- Pulse ~8–15ms; arm once on first user gesture (Chrome sticky activation)
- Wire to buttons and links (CTA / nav — confirm scope with user)
- Event-driven only (pointerdown), never per-frame
